    115          /**
    116           *    @brief    This method initializes the Timer interrupt module
    117           *    @details  1. This method should be called after initialization of all the modules like micro, Gpio, Hmi, Lsi,
    118           *    				Wide etc.
    119           *
    120           *              2. This function initializes the system tick timer and its interrupt and start the system tick timer.
    121           *		           Counter is in free running mode to generate periodical interrupts.
    122           *
    123           *		        3. You can change the SysTick IRQ priority by changing the below macro -
    124           *		        	#define SYSTICK_PREEMPTION_PRIORITY		0
    125           *
    126           *		        4. SysTick time base uses the below formula:
    127           *		                 Reload Value = SysTick Counter Clock (Hz) x  Desired Time base (s)
    128           */

